WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:02.410 line:10%
Todo negócio começa com uma

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:02.830 line:10%
ideia.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.790 line:10%
Mas ninguém compra o que

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:05.690 line:10%
não consegue ver.

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:06.250 line:10%
Olhar.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:07.070 line:10%
Desenhar.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:07.790 line:10%
Construir.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:08.730 line:10%
Marcas.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:09.670 line:10%
Páginas.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:11.070 line:10%
Caminhos digitais.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:16.230 line:10%
Começar perto.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:17.650 line:10%
Pensar longe.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.930 line:10%
Sua próxima fase começa com

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:25.810 line:10%
uma conversa.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:26.710 line:10%
Vision.
